  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>AFP III</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPIII-b-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Cut and add on-the- fly</li>\n<li>Twelve ¼” (6.4 mm) wide ends</li>\n<li>3 DOF in head / 3 DOF in part</li>\n<li>Linear motors for rapid accel/decel and placement accuracy</li>\n<li>Highly contoured convex and concave parts</li>\n<li>Placement rates up to 800 in/min (20 m/min) depending on contour</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Automated Fiber Placement</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-fiber-placement-afp/afp-i/\">AFP I</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-fiber-placement-afp/afp-ii/\">AFP II</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/automated-fiber-placement-afp/afp-iii/\">AFP III</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPIII-b-1.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPIII-b-1-300x288.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"288\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPIII-a-1.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-AFPIII-a-1-252x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"252\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
